{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_06_title", "source_sha256": "dedde7e37e83bd35ad8b273759ea86f2702bf14f73e186af146ef044f6775723", "ja": "自分の想いを超えて", "zh": "超越自己的心意", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "0cc1402a6319bdcf9afd7571b9f675b1a2119d7f692e0d857e458637a4331d42", "ja": "ミニライブを終え、天体公演に向けてお互\nいの長所を超えようと励むアイドル達は、\nその挑戦により瑞々しい初心を取り戻して\n本番のステージに向かう。そんな自分も、\n仲間も、すべてを超えて輝くために。", "zh": "结束迷你演唱会后，为了在天体公演中超越彼此的长处，偶像们相互鼓励，\n通过这次挑战找回了清新纯粹的初心，向正式演出舞台进发。为了超越这样的自己、\n伙伴，以及一切，绽放光芒。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_06_1000_p", "source_sha256": "78d85430d5f1444895d45f4c5f8e00b7c87ab44328b0e875694b84ce3acc8e9f", "ja": "（ミニライブを終え、天体公演のレッスンもいよいよ\n佳境を迎えている。みんなの様子は……）", "zh": "（迷你演唱会结束后，天体公演的排练也终于进入了关键阶段。大家的状态怎么样了呢……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_06_1001_006mak", "source_sha256": "4f34e18dd53aa0c070039ce21f847c20b6df2bbfa9d893f950298154beefc3cc", "ja": "くぅ～、今のところ、\nもっとキレイに歌いたいなぁ……。よし、もう一度！", "zh": "唔～到目前为止，\n我还想把歌唱得更好听一些……好，再来一次！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_06_1002_002chi", "source_sha256": "869d8ed38f2191215732e1379114fc9ec313a3e01f7fc3eae451a71aab175163", "ja": "はぁ、はぁ……。\nもう少し、振りを大きく見せないと……。", "zh": "哈啊，哈啊……还得把动作做得更大一些才行……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_06_1003_013hib", "source_sha256": "385343eecf4492c0f02e388b9078e16431743099ce69e7e6fb690956a36cfbeb", "ja": "うう～、音程が安定しないぞ～……。\nいや、できる！　自分ならできるんだ！", "zh": "呜呜～，音准还是不稳定啊～……  \n不，我能做到！我一定能做到！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_06_1004_010azu", "source_sha256": "2e33927021cb24b7dd662aa11bb020a05990efdaf4bef0081000215238d91604", "ja": "はぁ、はぁ……。も、もっと、\nアグレッシブに……、え～いっ！", "zh": "哈啊，哈啊……还、还要更积极主动一点……，嘿——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_06_1005_p", "source_sha256": "3ebed0646e04a929672c3201216f181b821ae5864f42a240137609b893c1395e", "ja": "（みんな、他のメンバーを追い越そうと頑張ってる。\nこの調子なら、本番も期待できそうだな……！）", "zh": "（大家都在努力追赶并超过其他成员。照这个势头来看，正式演出也很值得期待啊……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_06_1007_p", "source_sha256": "70a17ad92bfa964710c68b1f9db948552d033704e0ffffa96c777f51a3ecbbd6", "ja": "みんな、お疲れさま！\n一旦、休憩にしよう！", "zh": "大家，辛苦了！\n先休息一下吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_06_1008_006mak", "source_sha256": "bd1f1698b86182106c5e5b155b070d0cd0a64d14bc0dd37d7d8380c6ffcc9006", "ja": "はい！　なんか、こうやってレッスンしてると、\n思い出しますね。", "zh": "是！总觉得像这样一起训练，就会想起一些事情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_06_1009_p", "source_sha256": "e2b1dc6b792db727c2681c57b7b8f98a32c9d6d2bb9f19344235c401f113a3c4", "ja": "思い出す……？", "zh": "想起来……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_06_1010_006mak", "source_sha256": "d7f2af2b15cdb2e093a2d6e196e70f59bf7005db26513326ded31b7fd0c6bb97", "ja": "はい。デビューした頃は、できないことばっかりで、\nでも少しずつできるようになるのが楽しかったんです。", "zh": "是的。刚出道的时候，尽是些做不到的事情，\n但能一点点学会，我觉得很开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_06_1011_013hib", "source_sha256": "9f9b1dacb38a5ba6f3248ccd8cb9ac790cf36b07bfd9f9a011bd5323fb795404", "ja": "自分は最初からカンペキだったけどね！\nでも、ここまで本気のボイトレは懐かしいさ～。", "zh": "我一开始就是完美的哦！不过，像这样认真进行声乐训练，还真让人怀念啊～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_06_1012_010azu", "source_sha256": "42e48b5dfa0aacb41cbc06409ab6d5b21c2b0eeafb0504707f955dc6d2bee04e", "ja": "私も、ダンスを初めて習った時を思い出しました。\n自分の身体じゃないみたいです。うふふっ♪", "zh": "我也想起了第一次学习跳舞时的情景。\n感觉身体都不像是自己的了。呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_06_1013_002chi", "source_sha256": "56f8a958f88dc4027b384cb04dad066413904c536e89c4c6724fb77258ac22bc", "ja": "身体の動きと連動することで、歌も変わっていく……。\n知っていたはずなのに、あらためて実感しています。", "zh": "身体的动作与歌声相互联动，歌声也会随之改变……\n明明早就知道这一点，却还是再次切身体会到了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_06_1014_006mak", "source_sha256": "a4072969df2985659ef6be61e2fa9dc2cce78ffb80ab06bb0ab6a9e6a34b98c9", "ja": "そうそう、そういうのが全部、嬉しいんだよね！\n初心に返ったっていうのかな？", "zh": "对对，那种种的一切都会让人高兴呢！该说是回到了初心吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_06_1015_013hib", "source_sha256": "44bc30870f1107dfa11bfa7b8f5f3888a27acbb6a0d6761fb172a07a9235e310", "ja": "うんっ、自分もデビューした頃の勢いを取り戻した\n気がするぞ。これでもう無敵だよね！　あっははは！", "zh": "嗯！我也感觉自己找回了刚出道时的冲劲。\n这样一来，我们已经无敌了吧！啊哈哈哈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_06_1016_p", "source_sha256": "22c46a6312a7c9ae71521a48be1cf8097aa42fd4bc79a56e40b579b9d5c66104", "ja": "頼もしいな。その調子でこれからもどんどん、\n自分に挑戦していこうか！", "zh": "真让人放心。那就保持这个势头，今后也不断挑战自我吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_06_1017_006mak", "source_sha256": "c8437da922b05a66a006272ae646cc70f57e96453c9e5b620e3abbd8e90368f7", "ja": "はい！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_06_1018_002chi", "source_sha256": "c8437da922b05a66a006272ae646cc70f57e96453c9e5b620e3abbd8e90368f7", "ja": "はい！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_06_1019_010azu", "source_sha256": "c8437da922b05a66a006272ae646cc70f57e96453c9e5b620e3abbd8e90368f7", "ja": "はい！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_06_1020_013hib", "source_sha256": "c8437da922b05a66a006272ae646cc70f57e96453c9e5b620e3abbd8e90368f7", "ja": "はい！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_06_1021_null", "source_sha256": "f80526576c5e9b4ef112796495758799d09a67f1720109820e2846980c7d768b", "ja": "そして、天体公演当日……", "zh": "然后，到了天体公演当天……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_06_1022_006mak", "source_sha256": "70896821a4755815c0caed4d5d7708f0f5e17180af8f64a88506abfd9d45a75b", "ja": "……。どうしよう。\nボク、なんか、緊張してるかも……！", "zh": "……怎么办才好。\n我、我好像有点紧张……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_06_1023_010azu", "source_sha256": "025fa3ca229a7d7a8cf362a047113a979bcf344b20cc2de9fdbd3dce299a3c25", "ja": "まあ、真ちゃんも？　じつは私もなの。\nさっきから、手の震えが止まらなくて……。", "zh": "哎呀，小真也是吗？其实我也是呢。\n刚才开始手就一直抖个不停……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_06_1024_013hib", "source_sha256": "bf5971dd8007ed9b68f6f2709a0798bb7acc4807b3e41b5062f04df454d952ba", "ja": "じ、自分は平気だって、思ってたんだけど……。\nなんか、さっきからドキドキするぞ？", "zh": "我、我还以为自己没事的……可是，不知道为什么，从刚才开始心里一直怦怦直跳？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_06_1025_002chi", "source_sha256": "50f86a2d82fa5a778f592b0b626fb9dbebfc5dde4c96044abccbe1f4adf4b8f2", "ja": "私も……。\nでも、これは不安というより……期待？", "zh": "我也是……不过，这与其说是不安……不如说是期待？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_06_1026_p", "source_sha256": "ce2d8b61303857e98b6564cc43a42adbb61b11a0abf29d4f8e136ac381079bfb", "ja": "その期待と緊張は、\n新しい挑戦の成果かもしれないな。", "zh": "那份期待和紧张，或许正是这次全新挑战带来的成果吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_06_1027_p", "source_sha256": "227c68387a6199e45ce4da859945dc1ed1458afbe076cdb088facf96e0791263", "ja": "本気の挑戦をしたから、真剣だからこそ期待するし、\n緊張もする。そういうことだと思うよ。", "zh": "正因为是认真发起了挑战，也正因为全力以赴，所以才会有所期待，也会感到紧张。我想就是这么回事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_06_1028_p", "source_sha256": "7465f316835e6cb0a413a0b0b200a8a8ac9ae93677c25322056770f272eac18b", "ja": "だから、まずは深呼吸でもして……。\nいや、何か温かいものの方が良かったかな？", "zh": "所以，先做个深呼吸……  \n不对，喝点热乎的东西是不是更好？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_06_1029_010azu", "source_sha256": "e67a3c78a2380eb9cbddfd3b2f67f6e8fc5f92fae537551b9b76906a4e165d0b", "ja": "うふふっ、なんだか{$P$}さんも、\n期待して、緊張してるみたいですね♪", "zh": "呵呵，感觉{$P$}先生也是，\n既期待又紧张呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_06_1030_p", "source_sha256": "a37457e14c1111e94f2c6a0f4b104eabb0f4ac7730f8382cddbe1b1cf0ea5394", "ja": "あ……はは、そうですね。\nはい、みんなのおかげで！", "zh": "啊……哈哈，是啊。\n没错，多亏了大家！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_06_1031_p", "source_sha256": "4ed5ed424e7f581c2a3139ddeb520986a8bad18435f1839fc992cddc8c55bf6e", "ja": "そして、この緊張を乗り越えるのも、挑戦だと思う。\nだから、思いっきり自分に期待して……。", "zh": "而且，我觉得克服这份紧张也是一种挑战。\n所以，就尽情期待自己的表现吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_06_1032_p", "source_sha256": "7a003fa6f055f1a7b572e7c0c1a5a1c5112370545f870f2c9501ce4fe3a4da85", "ja": "最高のステージにしよう！", "zh": "让我们打造最棒的舞台！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_06_1033_006mak", "source_sha256": "d0fb844ccdef1b0dd9a7943d5b738fb7b8a60ddfee124ac3ba610c5132419bf9", "ja": "はい！　緊張にも、自分にも、仲間にも負けません！\n目の前にある全部を……、超えてみせます！", "zh": "好的！我不会输给紧张、不会输给自己，也不会输给伙伴们！\n眼前的一切……我都会超越给你看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_06_1034_audience", "source_sha256": "e164b7a129efaeace3127b58988443165329b31828d55b374c1a021c23e1934d", "ja": "ワアアアアァァァァーッ！！！！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊啊啊啊——！！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
